# Evaluation outputs (eval/results/):
#   - report.md is the publishable Markdown report and IS tracked.
#   - *.json / *.csv are transient machine-readable artifacts that change on
#     every run and are intentionally NOT tracked.
eval/results/*.json
eval/results/*.csv
